  "tinai": "unknown",
  "sangamTamil": "தமரென்று தாங்கொள்ளப் பட்டவர் தம்மைத்\nதமரன்மை தாமறிந்தா ராயின், - அவரைத்\nதமா஢னும் நன்கு மதித்துத் தமரன்மை\nதம்முள் அடக்கிக் கொளல்.",
  "urai": null,
  "english": "If friends prove unfaithful, love them the more, and keep the secret of their unfaithfulness in your own bosom. If we perceive those we have accepted as our own to be not really ours, we must pay even more respect to them than to our own, and keep concealed in our own mind the fact that they are not really ours.",
